go-to: prussia_minister_president if heartland_leader == "Bristol"

We have enough votes to form a "Unity Coalition" government consisting of the <span style="color: #c00000;">**Marchers**</span>, [? if unionist_party_name != "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">Unionists</span>?][? if unionist_party_name == "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">**Concord**</span>?] and [? if ddp_name == "Gold" and not lvp_formed: <span style="color: #D3C24D;">**Democratic**</span>?][? if ddp_name == "DStP" and not lvp_formed: <span style="color: #D3C24D;">**State**</span>?][? if lvp_formed: <span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span>?] [? if not lvp_formed: (<span style="color: #D3C24D;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span>)?][? if lvp_formed: (<span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span>)?] parties! This has been the governing coalition since 1919. [? if liberal_parliament == 1: The liberal parliamentary group has come under strain to the <span style="color: #D3C24D;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span> acting on its own accord. ?] 

[? if heartland_leader != "Bristol": [+ heartland_leader +] is selected to be the Minister-President of Heartland. ?]

