go-to: prussia_minister_president if heartland_leader == "Bristol"

We have formed a majority coalition with the <span style="color: #c00000;">**Marchers**</span>, [? if unionist_party_name != "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">Unionists</span>?][? if unionist_party_name == "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">**Concord**</span>?], [? if ddp_name == "Gold" and not lvp_formed: <span style="color: #D3C24D;">**Democratic**</span>?][? if ddp_name == "DStP" and not lvp_formed: <span style="color: #D3C24D;">**State**</span>?][? if lvp_formed: <span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span>?] [? if not lvp_formed: (<span style="color: #D3C24D;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span>)?][? if lvp_formed: (<span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span>)?][? if not lvp_formed: , and <span style="color: #C0A054;">**People's**</span> (<span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span>)?] parties. [? if weimar_coalition_heartland >= 50 or was_in_weimar_coalition_heartland: Our choice to include the <span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span> in government despite us having the option to maintain the Unity coalition is a conciliatory move towards the bourgeois parties. ?]

