[? if far_right_coalition_heartland + unionist_r_heartland >= 50: The <span style="color: #000000;">Unionist Party</span>'s failure to form a coalition with the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Royalists**</span>, due to the latter's insistence on securing both the Minister-President's office and control of the Heartland police, has left no alternative but to call new elections. ?]

New Heartland elections have been set for [+ next_election_month_heartland : month +] [+ next_election_year_heartland +].

[? if anti_democratic_votes >= 30: The people's faith in democracy is shaken by this ordeal. Of course, the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Royalists</span> are exploiting the instability to claim that democracy is unworkable, and that the Commonwealth needs a strong leader. ?]